{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Komatose</i> is a psychological horror point-and-click adventure that drags you into the dark corners of your own mind. After being violently attacked in a quiet town\u2014one where crime is almost unheard of\u2014you slip into a trauma-induced coma. But even in unconsciousness, you can't escape. Your mind becomes a twisted landscape, a distorted reflection of the hospital in which you are recovering, and you must navigate it to uncover the truth about what happened.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Power Saver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/761384aefd327b45bb63c9194c3fcf2f76bb4804.jpg"},{"name":"Sonar Technician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/22af5890d41efb03071281cffd6b7130253f1836.jpg"},{"name":"Overconfidence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/d530d965d76a4badfd9439e8fa535732af57f69a.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/92a65ce763abe1e21fe9488eb9851af6940c606f.jpg"},{"name":"Baby's First Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/f082caedb075592a9f2952a288b6b103c8c33255.jpg"},{"name":"That's Not a Phone...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/ac531adbb310de32ca28f0f9f84cc552af831f78.jpg"},{"name":"TV Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/222c1efb600031ae6c4d94727a7081edfeb87038.jpg"},{"name":"That Metallica Song","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/daa9323bba2d6d5cb87bde9407e29390bfc99bfe.jpg"},{"name":"Not Today, NSA!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4046020/a3e53171d09ff7560f4c6a5d5984d593f743c3a4.jpg"},{"name":"Ready For His Clos